/pane-shell.tsx:503-508` applies that gutter to the live hover-reveal trigger.\n- Commit `8fe334b056d4ab83e51a2abf2ca4d1ac8982770a` (`fix(desktop): inset hover-reveal trigger past the adjacent scrollbar (#44159)`) fixed the exact overlap/click-interception behavior and is an ancestor of current `main`.\n- The fix shipped in `v2026.6.19`.\n- The member-linked duplicate, #42837, tracked the same symptom and was closed after this implementation landed.\n", "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4985019330/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}]